---
import { site } from "../data/site";
import Icons from "./icons/Icons.astro";

interface Props {
  country?: "japan" | "taiwan";
}

const { country = "japan" } = Astro.props;

const closingWish =
  country === "japan"
    ? "祝你下次去日本玩得開心，也順利退稅！🤣💛"
    : "祝你台灣旅行玩得開心！💛";
---

<section
  class="mt-16 rounded-2xl border border-border-soft bg-paper-soft p-6 md:p-8"
  aria-labelledby="after-cta-title"
>
  <h2
    id="after-cta-title"
    class="text-lg font-bold text-brand-brown md:text-xl"
  >
    💛 喜歡我的分享，也歡迎追蹤黃踢那！
  </h2>
  <p class="mt-3 text-sm leading-relaxed text-ink-700">
    我會繼續分享日本、台灣的私房景點、旅宿體驗和實用攻略！
  </p>

  <hr class="my-5 border-0 border-t border-dashed border-border-soft" />

  <p class="text-sm leading-relaxed text-ink-700">
    🧳 也歡迎加入我的 LINE 旅行社群——
    <strong class="text-brand-brown">
      「跟著黃踢那出發吧｜旅行情報＆限定好康」
    </strong>
  </p>
  <p class="mt-2 text-sm leading-relaxed text-ink-700">
    這裡會分享最新旅遊情報、旅宿優惠，也歡迎大家一起聊行程、交流旅行心得！
  </p>

  <div class="mt-5 flex flex-wrap gap-3">
    <a
      href={site.social.lineCommunity}
      target="_blank"
      rel="noopener noreferrer"
      data-ga-event="join_line"
      data-ga-label="after_article_cta"
      class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 rounded-full bg-brand-teal px-5 py-2.5 text-sm font-medium text-brand-cream transition hover:brightness-95"
    >
      <Icons name="line" size={18} />
      加入 LINE 社群
    </a>
    <a
      href={site.social.instagram}
      target="_blank"
      rel="noopener noreferrer"
      data-ga-event="follow_ig"
      data-ga-label="after_article_cta"
      class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 rounded-full bg-brand-orange px-5 py-2.5 text-sm font-medium text-brand-brown transition hover:brightness-95"
    >
      <Icons name="instagram" size={18} />
      追蹤 IG
    </a>
  </div>

  <p class="mt-6 text-sm leading-relaxed text-ink-700">
    希望這份攻略對你有幫助，{closingWish}
  </p>
</section>
